# Get a Leg Up, {G} instant: "Until end of turn, target creature gets +1/+1 for each creature you control and gains reach" (CR 611.2a,
# 608.2h, 702.17). Bot1 controls Llanowar Elves and Fyndhorn Elves, Bot2 one Llanowar Elves of its own: Bot1 targets its own Llanowar
# Elves, which counts itself, so +2/+2 (a 3/3 with reach), not +3/+3 (Bot2's creature is not counted). The count is checked once as it
# resolves: Elvish Mystic cast afterwards leaves the 3/3 as it is. On turn 5 the effect has ended with the turn.

